{"id":51866,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51866"},"modified":"2026-09-02T23:03:50","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T22:03:50","slug":"grifo-24h","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grifo-24h\/","title":{"rendered":"Grifo 24h 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Grifo 24h 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>III Edi\u00e7\u00e3o do GRIFO24h 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no fim de semana de <strong>14 e 15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, no interior do <strong>Quartel da Unidade de Interven\u00e7\u00e3o da GNR (Pontinha)<\/strong>, em <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Promovida pela <strong>Unidade de Interven\u00e7\u00e3o da Guarda Nacional Republicana<\/strong> em parceria com o <strong>Clube de Praticantes Real Academia &#8211; Atletismo<\/strong>, a prova encerra com chave de ouro o <strong>Circuito Nacional de Corridas de Resist\u00eancia de 24 Horas<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Disputado num circuito fechado com <strong>2.235,03 metros homologado pela Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atleti