r-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os formatos e hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As 24H partem \u00e0s 11:00 de s\u00e1bado (14 Nov), a Maratona Noturna \u00e0s 19:00, as 12H \u00e0s 23:00 e a prova de 3H \u00e0s 08:00 de domingo (15 Nov).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como \u00e9 o percurso e que homologa\u00e7\u00e3o possui?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O circuito fechado tem a extens\u00e3o exata de 2.235,03 metros, dist\u00e2ncia devidamente certificada pela Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que servi\u00e7os de alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o e descanso est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o fornece refei\u00e7\u00f5es completas (sopa, bifanas, jantar, pequeno-almo\u00e7o e refor\u00e7o cont\u00ednuo), al\u00e9m de zona de paddock para tendas de descanso.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a vertente solid\u00e1ria do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova apoia o programa \u00abTodos os Passos Contam\u00bb (Funda\u00e7\u00e3o Galp) e convida cada atleta a entregar um bem alimentar n\u00e3o perec\u00edvel para o Banco Alimentar.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Grifo 24h 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Quartel da Unidade de Interven\u00e7\u00e3o da GNR (Pontinha)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Unidade de Interven\u00e7\u00e3o da GNR \/ Real Academia Atletismo\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a III Edi\u00e7\u00e3o do GRIFO24h 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se nos dias 14 e 15 de novembro de 2026 no Quartel da Unidade de Interven\u00e7\u00e3o da GNR, na Pontinha (Lisboa).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os formatos e hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As 24H partem \u00e0s 11:00 de s\u00e1bado (14 Nov), a Maratona Noturna \u00e0s 19:00, as 12H \u00e0s 23:00 e a prova de 3H \u00e0s 08:00 de domingo (15 Nov).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como \u00e9 o percurso e que homologa\u00e7\u00e3o possui?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O circuito fechado tem a extens\u00e3o exata de 2.235,03 metros, dist\u00e2ncia devidamente certificada pela Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que servi\u00e7os de alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o e descanso est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o fornece refei\u00e7\u00f5es completas (sopa, bifanas, jantar, pequeno-almo\u00e7o e refor\u00e7o cont\u00ednuo), al\u00e9m de zona de paddock para tendas de descanso.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a vertente solid\u00e1ria do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova apoia o programa \u00abTodos os Passos Contam\u00bb (Funda\u00e7\u00e3o Galp) e convida cada atleta a entregar um bem alimentar n\u00e3o perec\u00edvel para o Banco Alimentar.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51867,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,559,31],"event_type_2":[33,727],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51866","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-pontinha-lisboa","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-de-15-km","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_4-solidarias-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Cartaz-Grifo.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51866","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https: